    "teacher_markdown": "**Student Takeaways:**\r\n- Students learn how to apply multiple logical operators (such as &, |, and >=) in pandas to create complex filters for more precise data analysis.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Possible Misconceptions and/or Difficulties:**\r\n- Students might struggle with the correct use of parentheses to group conditions properly when using multiple logical operators.\r\n- There might be confusion between the logical operators (e.g., | for OR and & for AND) and their effects on the filtering process, leading to unexpected results.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
